        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>the looks</strong><br>Pixelated graphics combined with simple geometry and models inside a 3D space for a simple and nostalgic experience!<br><br><strong>gameplay</strong><br>You get to play as a test subject in the testing grounds of an evil AI whereby, using your shotgun's knockback, you traverse the facility in order to face this evil AI!<br>If you aren't able to get past a certain level, you can always use the level selector in the main menu so that you don't miss any gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>why was this made anyway?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a start to my long jurney on becoming a great game developer i made this game as a starting point, inspired by some of my favorite games i hope this to be the mark of my begining and an inspiration to others that anyone can make video game.</p>",
